      "kind": "object",
      "code": "// Two spheres along z, bottom radius at z = -height/2 and top at +height/2, and the cone touching\n// both (shapes.js NroundCone). A height under the radii's difference leaves the bigger sphere.\nC = add_new(C, NroundCone(p, bottom, top, height), MATERIAL);",
      "params": {
        "bottom": 0.3,
